  "_note": "Demo data-center layout for InfraGuard AI, not a real facility. The backend expands rows into racks; each rack holds monitored drives and GPU servers (8 GPUs each). Each row runs one synchronous GPU job across all its servers, so the slowest GPU sets the pace for the whole row (a demo assumption); coordinates are floor-grid cells (one cell is about one 0.6 m floor tile). Facility equipment (power, cooling plant, network, safety and security) is placed as hall units; every rack also has a power strip (pdu-<rack>) and a top-of-rack switch (tor-<rack>).",
